pre-download an Ollama model on a dev PC and transfer it to a server

📍 1. Find model storage on dev PC
Linux / Docker / WSL:
~/.ollama/models
Docker (common path inside container):
/root/.ollama/models


📁 3. Stop Ollama (important)
systemctl stop ollama

or Docker:

docker stop ollama

4. Copy models to server

You can also archive models:

tar -czf ollama-models.tar.gz ~/.ollama/models

Then transfer:

scp ollama-models.tar.gz user@server:/root/

5. On server start Ollama
ollama list

If everything is correct, model will appear immediately.

Extract on server:

tar -xzf ollama-models.tar.gz -C ~/.ollama/
